This repository is the official client for the EnergyFlowX MCP service. It is
published so that users of that service have a plugin that is correct and
maintained by its authors, rather than an unofficial one that goes stale. Being
public is not a grant of rights beyond the permission stated below, and is not an
invitation to copy.

